OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start to the day but
OL,6,Fmostly dry, with spells of warm
OL,7,Fsunshine into the afternoon. The
OL,8,Fchance of a few light showers drifting
OL,9,Fin on the easterly breeze first thing.
OL,10,FLight to moderate easterly breeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry evening as cloud
OL,13,Fthickens and lowers overnight. A few
OL,14,Fspots of rain developing in the north
OL,15,Ffor a time. Staying mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
