OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FLow cloud first thing, but
OL,6,Fwill lift and break through the
OL,7,Fmorning, bringing some brighter spells
OL,8,Faway from coastal areas. Thunderstorms
OL,9,Fpossible by late afternoon. Another
OL,10,Fwarm and humid day.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FChangeable weather with spells of
OL,14,Fheavy rain, some thunderstorms and
OL,15,Fstrong winds. Brighter intervals and
OL,16,Fscattered showers at times.
OL,17,FTemperatures mostly near normal,
OL,18,Ffeeling warm and humid in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
